  "body": "Competitively priced below CV!\r\n\r\nPerched on one of Millwater's most desirable elevated streets, this beautifully presented residence offers sensational sea views, multiple living options with auxiliary kitchenette, private, protected outdoor living, large garage workshop and tons of off-street parking.\r\n\r\nDesigned to accommodate a range of lifestyles. It can be configured as a 3-bedroom, 3-living area home; a 4-bedroom, 2-living area home; or a 5-bedroom, 1-living area home, easily adapting to growing families, guests, multi-generational living, or those working from home.\r\n\r\nAt its heart is a modern entertainer's kitchen with a generous sunlit scullery, flowing seamlessly into the open-plan dining and living spaces and out to a covered north-facing patio, perfect for year-round entertaining or simply relaxing in the sun and enjoying the views.\r\n\r\nThe spacious master bedroom suite features a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while the remaining bedrooms are generously sized and well positioned. Multiple living areas allow the family to come together while still enjoying their own space, with many rooms capturing stunning views towards the outer Hauraki Gulf, surrounding township and recreation reserves.\r\n\r\nCompleting the package is a generous double garage with full workshop and built in workbench, excellent storage, and dedicated parking for a boat, motorhome, or trailer. Landscaping is hardy, mature, manicured and striking to the eye. Double side gates allow easy access for deliveries and a trailer when required.\r\n\r\nWalking distance to Millwater's cafés, shops, schools, sports facilities, public transport, and the picturesque Orewa Estuary walkway, this exceptional home combines lifestyle, versatility, convenience, and quality in one outstanding package.\r\n\r\nVendors are downsizing and have made their instructions clear. Ignore previous asking price indications. Will be sold!",
